This licence covers the source in `backend/src`, `web/src`, `sidecar/`, `docs/`,
`design/` and the build files. It does not cover the third-party components
Monoline vendors or downloads at runtime, which keep their own terms:

| Component | Location | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| GSAP | `backend/vendor/gsap.min.js` | GreenSock Standard License — see `backend/vendor/gsap-LICENSE.txt` |
| KaTeX | `backend/vendor/katex/` | MIT — see `backend/vendor/katex/katex-LICENSE.txt` |
| Lucide icons | `backend/vendor/lucide/` | ISC — see `backend/vendor/lucide/LICENSE-ISC.txt` |
| Noto Sans SC (subset source) | `backend/vendor/fonts/` | SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see `backend/vendor/fonts/OFL.txt` |
| HyperFrames (engine, producer, player) | installed from npm | Apache License 2.0 |
| kokoro-onnx (TTS runtime) | Python dependency | MIT |
| Kokoro-82M model weights | downloaded to `~/.cache/hyperframes/tts` on first use, not redistributed here | Apache License 2.0 |
| Chrome Headless Shell | downloaded to `~/.cache/hyperframes/chrome` on first use | Chromium project terms |

